    {
      "id": "beat_prologue_alarm",
      "content": "You are lounging on the apartment sofa, scrolling on your phone as the night deepens outside. A piercing fire alarm shatters the quiet, followed by running footsteps and muffled screams in the hallway. You sit up sharply—acrid smoke is already seeping through the door gap, and your heart races.",
